<title>THAILAND: BOXING-YOKTHAI RETAINS WBA BANTAMWEIGHT TITLE.</title>
<headline>BOXING-YOKTHAI RETAINS WBA BANTAMWEIGHT TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's Yokthai Sith Oar retained the World Boxing Association (WBA) junior bantamweight title on Friday in a unanimous points decision over Venezuelan challenger Jesus Rojas.</p>
<p>It was the fourth defence for Yokthai, who won the title last August by knocking out Alimi Goitia.</p>
</text>
